  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce."
    },
    {
      "text": "Juice lime into a medium bowl. Add oil and spices, then whisk to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve grape tomatoes. Add to the bowl with the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Shave cilantro leaves off the stems; discard stems and mince the leaves. Add to the bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse corn under hot water (from the tap) to thaw. Add to the bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse beans. Add to the bowl, along with feta, and stir to combine the salad."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide salad between plates or bowls. Enjoy!"
    }
